      analogy: "Imagine an open-office whiteboard where a clerk is writing down a long financial address ('12345 West Corporation Boulevard'). This is the shared variable. If a priority alarm bell fires (Edge Interrupt) while the clerk has only managed to write down '12345 West', the clerk drops the pen and runs to attend the emergency handler. If the responder inside that emergency handler reads the board, they get completely broken, partial information. To fix this, the clerk must lock the office door (Disable Global Interrupts) for the exact 2 seconds it takes to write the full address, opening it the instant the data is safe."
